3.3.4 Sequence bookmarks — ‘bookmark-gt-set-sequence’
-----------------------------------------------------

A sequence bookmark stores a list of bookmark names under the ‘sequence’
alist key.  Jumping visits each in order via ‘bookmark-jump’.

   Interactive: prompts for the sequence name, then reads existing
bookmark names one at a time until you enter empty input.

   Elisp:

     (bookmark-gt-set-sequence "morning-workspace"
                               '("inbox" "todo.org" "calendar"))


